    "The proposed rear dormer, by reason of its design, scale, bulk and siting, would represent a dominant and visually intrusive form of development that fails to appear subordinate to the host dwelling. It would be out of keeping with the established character and form of development, resulting in harm to the appearance of the property and surrounding area. The proposal is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD8, DMD13 and DMD37 of the Development Management Document (2014)."
